Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value ATTRIBUTE (\S+)
Value MODE (\S+)
Value BANDWIDTH (\S+)
Value ADMIN_STATUS (\S+)
Value PHY_STATUS (\S+)
Value PROTOCOL_STATUS (\S+)
Value DESCRIPTION (.*?)

Start
  ^Interface\s+Attribute\s+Mode
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${ATTRIBUTE}\s+${MODE}\s+${BANDWIDTH}\s+${ADMIN_STATUS}\s+${PHY_STATUS}\s+${PROTOCOL_STATUS}(?:\s+${DESCRIPTION})?\s*$$ -> Record
